Existing documents retain their exact type IDs. Install edition 3 alongside earlier editions and create new documents using its exported types. Do not silently rewrite old running documents. Within edition 3, approved updates may replace implementation types, adopt retained state, or copy state with a `from` claim. See SPECIFICATION.md.
